id: pm-gh1464
title: "GH-1464: Distinguish successful close follow-up from failure recovery"
description: "Successful warn-mode close returns failure-shaped recovery suggested_retry fields, causing agents to repeat an already completed action."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags: []
